Cell["\<\
The minimal model of a nilmanifold has no degenerate elements at all: the \
pairing is already perfect, so the model is its own nondegenerate quotient.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"255998ae-dbc5-478d-a28c-810f5c8c1606"],

